This repository is an English-language fork of MichengAI/dsh-pua (DSH PUA), a community
DeepSeek Harness plugin. It is not an official DeepSeek or PUA product.

Upstream plugin (code, runtime, build tooling):
  Source: https://github.com/MichengAI/dsh-pua
  License: Apache-2.0. LICENSE covers original plugin code of the upstream project and
  this fork's original code, build scripts, and docs.

Third-party content vendored under assets/pua:
  Files: the skills, commands, agents, and hooks files collected under assets/pua/upstream
         (one manifest entry per file, in assets/pua/upstream.json).
  Source: https://github.com/tanweai/pua
  Author: Tanwei Security Lab (探微安全实验室, per the upstream plugin.json author field)
  Version: 3.5.1
  Commit: e6e6cd237ad17750d179674bff52f8184abea8fd
  License: MIT (upstream plugin.json, .claude-plugin/plugin.json, skills/pua/SKILL.md)
  Status in this fork: the vendored files listed above have been TRANSLATED to English (semantic-accurate adaptation preserving the PUA tone; proper nouns romanized
  per GLOSSARY.md). Original Chinese bytes are pinned for provenance and differential
  vendoring:
    - Manifest: assets/pua/upstream.json (schemaVersion 2)
    - sourceSha256 / gitBlobSha256: SHA-256 of the original zh-CN bytes at the pinned commit
    - contentSha256: SHA-256 of the current runtime-served (English) bytes
  The MIT license applies to the upstream-derived content, translated or not.

Provenance notes:
  - Every file under assets/pua/upstream/ preserves the raw bytes of the pinned Git object;
    no line-ending conversion is applied to the vendored tree.
  - The upstream snapshot declares no standalone LICENSE file; metadata attestations are
    recorded here without claiming an upstream copyright file. Original authors' rights
    are not affected by any attribution in this project's LICENSE.
  - Hooks are used as reference/template sources; the actual runtime mechanics are
    TypeScript wired into DSH, never executing the upstream installer or shell hooks.

